  "row_count": 21,
  "notes": {
    "raw": "\\*Data except enthalpy of formation at 298 K estimated. \nPhase change: 1795 K, melting point of Er; $\\Delta H^{\\circ} = 4.757$ kcal/mol. \nHeat capacity (cal/mol·K) and enthalpy (kcal/mol) equations: \n$$\n\\begin{array}{r l} 2 9 8. 1 5 - 2 0 0 0 \\mathrm{K}: & \\mathrm{Cp} ^ {\\circ} = 8. 8 7 5 + 0. 0 3 6 \\times 1 0 ^ {- 3} \\mathrm{T} - 0. 6 0 8 \\times 1 0 ^ {5} \\mathrm{T} ^ {- 2} \\\\ & \\mathrm{H} ^ {\\circ} - \\mathrm{H} _ {2 9 8} ^ {\\circ} = 8. 8 7 5 \\times 1 0 ^ {- 3} \\mathrm{T} + 0. 0 1 8 \\times 1 0 ^ {- 6} \\mathrm{T} ^ {2} + 0. 6 0 8 \\times 1 0 ^ {2} \\mathrm{T} ^ {- 1} - 2. 8 5 2 \\end{array}\n$$\nReaction equations (kcal/mol): \n$$\n\\begin{array}{l} 2 9 8. 1 5 - 1 7 9 5 \\mathrm{K}: \\quad \\Delta \\mathrm{Hr} ^ {\\circ} = 3 3. 6 5 0 - 0. 5 7 6 \\times 1 0 ^ {- 3} \\mathrm{T} - 1. 4 0 1 \\times 1 0 ^ {- 6} \\mathrm{T} ^ {2} + 8 6. 9 5 0 \\mathrm{T} ^ {- 1} \\\\ \\Delta G r ^ {\\circ} = 3 3. 6 5 0 + 0. 5 7 6 \\times 1 0 ^ {- 3} \\mathrm{TlnT} + 1. 4 0 1 \\times 1 0 ^ {- 6} \\mathrm{T} ^ {2} + 4 3. 4 7 5 \\mathrm{T} ^ {- 1} - 2 2. 0 4 5 \\times 1 0 ^ {- 3} \\mathrm{T} \\\\ 1 7 9 5 - 2 0 0 0 \\mathrm{K}: \\quad \\Delta \\mathrm{Hr} ^ {\\circ} = 3 1. 9 9 6 - 4. 5 4 6 \\times 1 0 ^ {- 3} \\mathrm{T} - 0. 1 4 2 \\times 1 0 ^ {- 6} \\mathrm{T} ^ {2} + 2 6. 6 5 0 \\mathrm{T} ^ {- 1} \\\\ \\Delta G r ^ {\\circ} = 3 1. 9 9 6 + 4. 5 4 6 \\times 1 0 ^ {- 3} \\mathrm{TlnT} + 0. 1 4 2 \\times 1 0 ^ {- 6} \\mathrm{T} ^ {2} + 1 3. 3 2 5 \\mathrm{T} ^ {- 1} - 4 8. 6 0 0 \\times 1 0 ^ {- 3} \\mathrm{T} \\\\ \\end{array}\n$$\nSource: Data from Mills (80) who estimated all except enthalpy of formation at 298 K. ",
    "lines_raw": [
      "\\*Data except enthalpy of formation at 298 K estimated.",
      "Phase change: 1795 K, melting point of Er; $\\Delta H^{\\circ} = 4.757$ kcal/mol.",
      "Heat capacity (cal/mol·K) and enthalpy (kcal/mol) equations:",
      "$$",
      "\\begin{array}{r l} 2 9 8. 1 5 - 2 0 0 0 \\mathrm{K}: & \\mathrm{Cp} ^ {\\circ} = 8. 8 7 5 + 0. 0 3 6 \\times 1 0 ^ {- 3} \\mathrm{T} - 0. 6 0 8 \\times 1 0 ^ {5} \\mathrm{T} ^ {- 2} \\\\ & \\mathrm{H} ^ {\\circ} - \\mathrm{H} _ {2 9 8} ^ {\\circ} = 8. 8 7 5 \\times 1 0 ^ {- 3} \\mathrm{T} + 0. 0 1 8 \\times 1 0 ^ {- 6} \\mathrm{T} ^ {2} + 0. 6 0 8 \\times 1 0 ^ {2} \\mathrm{T} ^ {- 1} - 2. 8 5 2 \\end{array}",
      "$$",
